  "description": "2-Bedroom to Let\n\nA bright and spacious two-bedroom, own-door ground-floor apartment in a quiet, well-established residential setting in Balbriggan, Co. Dublin.\n\nThe apartment is fully furnished and offers comfortable, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The generous living room benefits from attractive timber flooring and plenty of natural light, while the fitted kitchen provides ample cupboard and worktop space together with appliances.\n\nThe main bedroom is particularly appealing, with extensive built-in wardrobes and direct access through sliding doors to a private patio overlooking a mature green communal garden – a lovely feature that gives the apartment a peaceful, open outlook. \n\nThe second bedroom is also bright and well proportioned.\n\nThe property includes a bathroom with bath and shower, electric heating and one designated parking space.\n\nThe location is extremely convenient, with Balbriggan railway station, bus services, supermarkets, shops and other local amenities all within short walking distance.",
